{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the land of rising sun\nA journey grand a course to be run\nAttend then to this plan most bold\nA tale of Japan in days of old.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth land\nIn Tokyo's port a bustling strand\nThe Narita air a sight to see\nA taxi's haste to hotel decree.\nRest then and dine on ramen's grace\nA welcome feast in this wondrous place.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Splendor and Sacred Space**\n\nTo Imperial Palace we shall stride\nWhere ancient history doth reside\nMeiji Shrine a tranquil scene\nA verdant haven serene and keen.\nShibuya's crossing a vibrant show\nWhere human rivers ebb and flow.\n\n**Day Three: Culture's Embrace and Artistic Flair**\n\nAsakusa's temple a sight divine\nSenso-ji's bells a chime to shine\nUeno Park with museums vast\nWhere art and wonder forever last.\nGinza's shops a glittering array\nWhere merchants tempt with wares each day.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain View**\n\nHakone's hills a misty dream\nLake Ashi's waters a silver gleam\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nA picturesque scene a peaceful calm.\nThe Hakone Ropeway a soaring flight\nTo mountains grand a glorious sight.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we haste\nA city old with beauty graced\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA thousand pathways overhead.\nGion district geishas grace\nA whispered charm in this ancient place.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gleam a golden prize\nReflected beauty before our eyes\nRyoan-ji's garden a thoughtful art\nWhere stones reside and calm the heart.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove so tall\nA verdant whisper enthralling all.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey deer abound\nIn Nara Park on hallowed ground\nTodai-ji Temple a giant's hold\nWhere Buddha's image doth unfold.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns bright\nA mystical vision in fading light.\n\n**Day Eight: Osaka's Delights and Culinary Bliss**\n\nOsaka's markets a vibrant call\nDotonbori's lights enthralling all\nOsaka Castle a fortress grand\nA history etched across the land.\nTakoyaki's taste a savory treat\nA culinary joy bittersweet.\n\n**Day Nine: Farewell Japan a Fond Adieu**\n\nReturn to Tokyo's bustling shore\nTo gather memories forevermore\nDeparting Japan with grateful heart\nA journey's end a brand new start.\nFarewell fair land thy beauty stays\nIn hearts and minds through all our days.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.6643308401107788}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.08070793002843857}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.23804040253162384}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.5761467218399048}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.46493446826934814}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00020346954988781363}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.10751023888587952}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.0006475735572166741}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.028292039409279823}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.08245640248060226}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.9817976951599121}, {"token": "▁course", "logprob": -0.2758033871650696}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0465882271528244}, {"token": "▁be", "logprob": -0.00027378625236451626}, {"token": "▁run", "logprob": -0.03581087291240692}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.7133049964904785}, {"token": "Attend", "logprob": -1.5877511501312256}, {"token": "▁then", "logprob": -1.6958246231079102}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.042293842881917953}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -0.004563749767839909}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -0.22760982811450958}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.6327027082443237}, {"token": "▁bold", "logprob": -3.3043618202209473}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 